{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122806","id":4357791518,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABA76fHg","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122806","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122806.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122806.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122806","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122806/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122806/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122806/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/ca89aaa3b3e40ca94445b6bcc2c726ad2199a534","number":122806,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add missing `<memory>` includes in SVG module","user":{"login":"Chubercik","id":37378746,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3Mzc4NzQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37378746?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik","html_url":"https://github.com/Chubercik","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Fixes #121790.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI was able to reproduce the issue on my end:\r\n\r\n```cmd\r\nmodules/text_server_fb/thorvg_svg_in_ot.cpp: In function 'FT_Error tvg_svg_in_ot_render(FT_GlyphSlot, void**)':\r\nmodules/text_server_fb/thorvg_svg_in_ot.cpp:330:14: error: 'unique_ptr' is not a member of 'std'\r\n  330 |         std::unique_ptr<tvg::SwCanvas> sw_canvas(tvg::SwCanvas::gen());\r\n      |              ^~~~~~~~~~\r\nmodules/text_server_fb/thorvg_svg_in_ot.cpp:35:1: note: 'std::unique_ptr' is defined in header '<memory>'; this is probably fixable by adding '#include <memory>'\r\n   34 | #include \"core/io/xml_parser.h\"\r\n  +++ |+#include <memory>\r\n   35 | #include \"core/os/memory.h\"\r\nmodules/text_server_fb/thorvg_svg_in_ot.cpp:330:38: error: expected primary-expression before '>' token\r\n  330 |         std::unique_ptr<tvg::SwCanvas> sw_canvas(tvg::SwCanvas::gen());\r\n      |                                      ^\r\nmodules/text_server_fb/thorvg_svg_in_ot.cpp:330:40: error: 'sw_canvas' was not declared in this scope; did you mean 'swscanf_s'?\r\n  330 |         std::unique_ptr<tvg::SwCanvas> sw_canvas(tvg::SwCanvas::gen());\r\n      |                                        ^~~~~~~~~\r\n      |                                        swscanf_s\r\n```\r\n\r\nI think the solution proposed by @AThousandShips is the right one; including `<memory>` in affected files solves the issue.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":"",